Removed `MAPPABLE_FIELDS` from `pas.plugins.identity.api` and `pas.plugins.identity.core.utils.propertymap`, and `WRITABLE_FIELDS` from `pas.plugins.identity.core.profiles`, because the fields a property map may write now depend on the site's user type. Use `mappable_fields()` from `pas.plugins.identity.core.utils.propertymap` for the fields a map may write, or `api.UNMAPPABLE_FIELDS` for the ones it never may. @ericof
